## Original Content
<p>New AI-powered experiences, accessibility enhancements, and enterprise tools to better serve our global community of learners and customers Since our recent closing of the Coursera and Udemy combination, we’ve been focused on one priority: delivering more value for learners, partners, and customers. By bringing together our teams and expertise, we’re able to move faster and [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/accelerating-product-and-platform-innovations-across-coursera-and-udemy/">Accelerating Product and Platform Innovations Across Coursera and Udemy</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
The article announces the recent combination of Coursera and Udemy, focusing on accelerating product and platform innovations to better serve learners and customers. They are introducing AI-powered experiences, accessibility enhancements, and enterprise tools to deliver more value to their global community.

## Key Points
- Coursera and Udemy have recently completed their combination.
- The priority is delivering value through innovations in AI, accessibility, and enterprise tools.
- New AI-powered experiences are being developed to enhance learning.
- Accessibility improvements aim to serve a broader community.
- Enterprise tools are being enhanced to better support partners and customers.


